    "Name": "Karura KAU-5RB",
    "Details": "The KAU-5RB variant, now in field testing, addresses the base model’s long-range weaknesses by replacing the Heavy PPC with an Extended Range version. It also adds a center torso Medium Laser and two additional double heat sinks. Thanks to the spacious chassis and straightforward weapon swap, this upgrade is popular and can be completed within a few hours on the battlefield.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - PPC</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.08</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>\n\n<b><color=#0064e6>Used with permission from Aries Games and Miniatures.</color></b>",
